│ 12.1-15.3%) and a negative predictive value of 99.9% (95% CI 99.7-100.0%). The ratio of melanomas to benign skin     │
│ lesions excised was 1:5.1. In conclusion, specialized examination of pigmented skin lesions at the PLC offered good  │
