lesion, and the integrity of collagen. The objective of this study was to examine the usefulness of SIAscopy for the 
clinical diagnosis of malignant melanoma in a prospective, unbiased manner. We enrolled 65 patients with 83 lesions, 
where the diagnosis of melanoma could not be ruled out on the basis of the clinical evaluation by a nondermatologist. 
