  long‐term follow‐up to enable better recommendations for optimal sBCC treatment.Oxford University Press"},            
  {"study_index": 206, "title": "Dermoscopy for melanoma detection in family practice", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE To       
  assess the diagnostic accuracy and clinical utility of dermoscopy for melanoma detection in family practice. QUALITY  
