  heterogeneous with respect to patient characteristics, no single level of these parameters can be given that is       
  adequate for all subgroups. Use of these parameters as a basis for calculating diagnostic probabilities in            
  individual patients using Bayes\' theorem has serious limitations."}, {"study_index": 208, "title": "Do basal cell    
  carcinomas recur after complete conventional surgical excision?", "abstract": "For 1378 patients treated in the 11    
