4. Study 233: "Multiphoton laser tomography and fluorescence lifetime imaging of melanoma..." - Includes BCC in test set
with diagnostic accuracy data.
5. Study 248: "Dermoscopy and in vivo confocal microscopy are complimentary techniques..." - Evaluates dermoscopy/RCM 
