7. Study 268: "The U.K. skin cancer 'two‐week rule' proforma..." - Evaluates referral accuracy for SCC/melanoma with 
histological confirmation.
8. Study 272: "Comparison of classical dermatoscopy and acrylic globe magnifier dermatoscopy" - Evaluates dermoscopy for
BCC with accuracy metrics.
9. Study 277: "Reflectance confocal microscopy for diagnosing keratinocyte skin cancers in adults" - Systematic review 
evaluating RCM for BCC/cSCC.
10. Study 283: "Sensitivity and specificity of reflectance‐mode confocal microscopy for in vivo diagnosis of basal cell 
carcinoma..." - Evaluates RCM for BCC with sensitivity/specificity metrics.
11. Study 291: "A cancer‐registry‐assisted evaluation of the accuracy of digital epiluminescence microscopy..." - 
Evaluates dermoscopy for BCC with accuracy metrics.

**EXCLUSION REASONS (89 studies):**
